<%--
Widget_Grid - responsive grid of overview widget cards

default content - the widget cards (each a <Section> or <Card_Widget>)

The dashboard/overview layout container: it arranges independent widget cards
two-up on desktop and one-up on mobile, owning the gap between them (R1/R2 -
the container owns the spacing, the cards never carry outer margins). Replaces
the old Bootstrap `row` + `col-*` shells that wrapped each card in a column
(box-in-box). A card is a direct child of the grid.

Usage:
    <Widget_Grid>
        <Section $title="Recent Activity"> ... </Section>
        <Section $title="Today's Tasks"> ... </Section>
    </Widget_Grid>
--%>
<Define:Widget_Grid>
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Widget_Grid>
